        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>业绩综述 — 财产保险业务</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", sans-serif;\n    color: #231f20;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 1240px;\n    min-height: 1754px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 70px 90px 40px 90px;\n  }\n  h1.title-dark {\n    font-size: 46px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #231f20;\n    margin: 0;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  h1.title-orange {\n    font-size: 46px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #f26a21;\n    margin: 4px 0 0 0;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n  .section-label {\n    margin-top: 200px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #1a9c62;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .card {\n    margin-top: 30px;\n    background: #fdf4ee;\n    border-radius: 22px;\n    padding: 45px 40px 45px 20px;\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 20px;\n  }\n  .kpi-col {\n    width: 340px;\n    flex: 0 0 340px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 25px 0 25px 40px;\n  }\n  .kpi {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 18px;\n    margin: 40px 0;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    background: #fdece1;\n    border: 1px dashed #f0a877;\n    color: #b9713f;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n  }\n  .icon-ph {\n    width: 58px;\n    height: 58px;\n    flex: 0 0 58px;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n  }\n  .kpi-num {\n    font-size: 38px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #f26a21;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n  }\n  .kpi-num .small {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n  .kpi-num .prefix {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    color: #231f20;\n    font-weight: 400;\n  }\n  .kpi-label {\n    font-size: 19px;\n    color: #231f20;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n  }\n  .text-col {\n    flex: 1;\n    padding-right: 20px;\n  }\n  .block { padding: 6px 0 18px 0; }\n  .block + .block {\n    border-top: 1px dashed #e2b899;\n    padding-top: 22px;\n  }\n  .block h3 {\n    font-size: 19px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n    position: relative;\n    padding-left: 26px;\n    color: #231f20;\n  }\n  .block h3::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 8px;\n    width: 11px;\n    height: 11px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    border: 2px solid #f26a21;\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(circle, #f26a21 0 45%, transparent 46%);\n  }\n  .block p {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 16.5px;\n    line-height: 2;\n    text-align: justify;\n    padding-left: 26px;\n  }\n  .side-tab {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 0;\n    top: 610px;\n    width: 62px;\n    height: 480px;\n    background: #f26a21;\n    border-radius: 12px 0 0 12px;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .footer {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 90px;\n    right: 90px;\n    bottom: 45px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  .footer .left { color: #f26a21; font-weight: 700; }\n  .footer .right { color: #231f20; }\n  .footer .pageno {\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #231f20;\n    margin-left: 18px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <h1 class=\"title-dark\">业绩综述</h1>\n  <h1 class=\"title-orange\">财产保险业务</h1>\n\n  <div class=\"side-tab\">经营情况讨论及分析</div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-label\">财产保险业务概览</div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n\n    <div class=\"kpi-col\">\n\n      <div class=\"kpi\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder icon-ph\">[图标：钱袋]</div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"kpi-num\">98.3<span class=\"small\">%</span></div>\n          <div class=\"kpi-label\">整体综合成本率</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"kpi\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder icon-ph\">[图标：盾牌]</div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"kpi-num\">220<span class=\"small\">万亿元</span></div>\n          <div class=\"kpi-label\">小微企业风险保障</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"kpi\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder icon-ph\">[图标：车]</div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"kpi-num\"><span class=\"prefix\">近</span>2.36<span class=\"small\">亿</span></div>\n          <div class=\"kpi-label\">“平安好车主”<br>注册用户数</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"kpi\">\n        <div class=\"placeholder icon-ph\">[图标：警报]</div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"kpi-num\">105.5<span class=\"small\">亿次</span></div>\n          <div class=\"kpi-label\">发出灾害预警<br>信息累计次数</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"text-col\">\n\n      <div class=\"block\">\n        <h3>稳健增长助力高质量发展</h3>\n        <p>2024年，平安产险业务保持稳定增长，实现保险服务收入3,281.46亿元，同比增长4.7%。平安产险整体综合成本率98.3%，同比优化2.3个百分点，主要由保证保险业务承保损失下降影响。</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"block\">\n        <h3>扎实做好 “五篇大文章”</h3>\n        <p>平安产险立足服务实体经济的要求，不断探索 “保险+科技+服务” 新模式，提升服务实体经济质效，扎实做好金融 “五篇大文章”。2024年，平安产险累计开发覆盖20余个行业的6,500款产品，为240万小微企业提供了220万亿元风险保障；承保科技保险保单231万件，为6.9万家科技企业提供9万亿元风险保障。同时，平安产险协助推进城市型定制医疗保险项目124个，覆盖市民超3,000万，提供超60万亿元风险保障；承办长期护理保险项目覆盖参保群众超1,000万，累计支付护理待遇近1.8亿元。</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"block\">\n        <h3>推进高水平科技自立自强</h3>\n        <p>“平安好车主” APP致力于提供涵盖 “车保险、车服务、车生活” 的一站式服务，搭建82项服务覆盖用车全场景，洞察客户需求，精准推荐服务，客户满意度超97%。截至2024年12月末，“平安好车主” 注册用户数近2.36亿，月活跃用户数峰值突破4,100万。</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"block\">\n        <h3>风险减量提升服务质效</h3>\n        <p>中国平安联合中国灾害防御协会主办 “平安守护 • 防患未 ‘燃’” 公益活动，发布《城市重点消防安全与火灾防控指引》系列丛书，与中央财经大学、北京师范大学等机构联合发布《科技赋能风险减量服务白皮书》，提升公众灾害风险意识和防范能力。平安产险自主研发 “鹰眼系统DRS3.0”，包含自然灾害、意外事故、安责服务、万物互联四大模块，2024年累计发出台风、暴雨、洪水等灾害预警信息105.5亿次，覆盖6,734万个人及企业客户，助力提升防灾减灾应急能力。</p>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"left\">二零二四年年报</div>\n    <div class=\"right\">中国平安保险（集团）股份有限公司<span class=\"pageno\">39</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
